pg-improv (0.10.0-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for PostgreSQL 15 through 18.
  * Build with pgrx 0.19.3 and the shared locked dependency patch.
  * Require ICU headers for pgrx bindgen on PostgreSQL server headers.
  * Accept the Clang 15 toolchain used by the Ubuntu 22.04 builder.
  * Accept the Clang 21 toolchain used by the Ubuntu 26.04 builder.

 -- Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0800
